  id: 4
  context: "THE FIRE IN THE GUARD\u2019S CABIN, FOR\xCAT DE BR\xC9VANE\nSaturday
    evening around 7:30 p.m., the hut of the forest ranger Roger Vasseur caught fire
    in the heart of the forest of Br\xE9vane. The guard, absent, found an empty petrol
    can ten meters from the ruins and a boot print. The fire destroyed his logging
    records: he had been investigating illegal logging for months. At that time,
    the forest was frequented by hunters, loggers, walkers and beekeepers."
  facts: "D\xE9part de feu estim\xE9 \xE0 19h30\nFum\xE9e aper\xE7ue depuis la cr\xEAte
    \xE0 19h35\nBarri\xE8re de l'all\xE9e des Ch\xEAnes ouverte depuis 19h05\nBidon
    d'essence de 5 litres, bouchon vert\nEmpreintes de bottes pointure 43, semelle
    crant\xE9e\nNuit tomb\xE9e d\xE8s 18h, brume \xE9paisse"
